<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>WanderLust-Privacy</title>
    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/10828/10828620.png"
      type="image/png"
    />
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons link -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css"
    />
    <!-- Bootstrap CSS link -->
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
      integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    />
    <!-- FontAwesome CDN link -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.3.1/css/all.min.css"
      integrity="sha512-QeR2VH+lsBE5LSAe1Q5EnTBbe7XTBubt8dG93Y7gidSgdMCr8nVqKcfKAMyN96SV8KDbZVTDXChatu5G2KQGzg=="
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/style.css" />
  </head>
  <style>
    .privacy-link {
      display: none;
    }
  </style>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-6 privacy-container">
          <div class="signup-container">
            <b>Not yet registered?</b>
            <a href="/signup"
              ><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Sign up</button></a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="login-container">
            <b>Already Registered?</b>
            <a href="/login">
              <button class="btn btn-outline-success">Log in</button>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-6">
          <h2>WanderLust Privacy</h2>
          <br />
          <p>
            Our Privacy Policy explains what personal information we collect,
            how we use personal information, how personal information is shared,
            and privacy rights
          </p>
          <h4>Privacy Policy</h4>
          <p>
            Please review the supplemental privacy policies linked within the
            privacy policy documents, such as for certain Airbnb services, that
            may be applicable to you.
          </p>
          <br />
          <h3>INTRODUCTION</h3>
          <br />
          <p>
            Airbnb.org, Inc. <b>("Airbnb.org")</b> is a non-profit organization
            that enables and facilitates the provision of housing to persons in
            need in times of crisis and engages in related efforts to increase
            emergency preparedness and provide relief and support to impacted
            communities. We will often partner with other nonprofit
            organizations in pursuit of such efforts. The information that's
            shared with us helps us to execute our mission. Your trust is
            important to us and we're committed to protecting the privacy and
            security of your personal information. This privacy policy
            <b>("Privacy Policy")</b> describes how Airbnb.org collects, uses,
            processes, and discloses your personal information. Some of the
            programs we facilitate may require users to create an account on the
            Airbnb Platform or to make use of an existing account. When you use
            the Airbnb Platform as part of Airbnb.org's programs, the ways in
            which your information is collected, used, processed and disclosed
            is described in, and is subject to, the
            <a href="">Airbnb Privacy Policy.</a>
          </p>
          <br />
        </div>
        <div class="col-6">
          <h3>INFORMATION</h3>
          <p>
            When you create an account, we collect your name, email address,
            phone number, date of birth, and password. Hosts must also provide
            government-issued identification (such as passport or driver's
            license), proof of address, and background check authorization. You
            may choose to add additional details to your profile, including
            profile photo, bio, social media links, emergency contact
            information, and verification badges. Hosts must provide detailed
            information about their listings, including property photos,
            descriptions, amenities, house rules, pricing, availability
            calendar, and cancellation policies.
          </p>
          <br />
          <h3>Location</h3>
          <p>
            When you use our Platform, we collect precise location information
            (latitude/longitude) when you enable location services. This is used
            to show nearby listings, calculate distances, and provide
            location-based recommendations. You can disable location sharing in
            your device settings or account preferences at any time.We
            automatically collect information about the device you use to access
            our Platform, including device type, operating system version,
            unique device identifiers, mobile network information, browser type
            and version, and device settings.We track your interactions with our
            Platform, including pages visited, listings viewed, filters used,
            bookings initiated and completed, time spent on the Platform,
            clicks, and searches. This helps us understand user behavior and
            improve the Platform experience.We use cookies (small text files
            stored on your device) to remember your preferences, keep you logged
            in, analyze Platform usage, and deliver personalized content.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-6 offset-3">
          <h3>Legal Requirements and Protection</h3>
          <p>
            We may disclose your information without your consent when: Required
            by law, regulation, court order, or governmental request (including
            subpoenas) Necessary to comply with our legal obligations Necessary
            to protect the safety, rights, and property of Wanderlust, our
            users, or the public To enforce our Terms of Service and other
            agreements In response to claims of illegal activity or policy
            violations To prevent fraud or detect security vulnerabilities. We
            do NOT sell your personal information to third parties for their
            marketing purposes. We do NOT share your full payment card details,
            bank account information, or government ID documents with hosts,
            guests, or unauthorized third parties.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="route-listing">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-compass compass"></i>
      <a href="/listings"><h5>Go to WanderLust</h5></a>
    </div>
    <%- include("../includes/footer.ejs") %>

    <!-- Bootstrap JS link -->
    <script
      src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
      integrity="sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>
  </body>
</html>
